# Aero7: the Windows 7 application palette.
#
# Windows 7 was a light theme with a very small palette: #f0f0f0 chrome,
# #ffffff content, black text, and #3399ff for anything selected. Everything
# below is that, mapped onto KDE's colour roles.
#
# The window frame is glass, i.e. drawn by the Aero7 Aurorae theme rather than
# by these colours; [WM] only matters for whatever still asks KWin for a
# titlebar colour.

